# UI / UX (mobile-led)

**Authority for interaction & visual UX.** Layout/breakpoints → `18-mobile-first-responsive.mdc`. Shells/a11y → `05-components.mdc`. CWV → `09` / `10`. Brand: `dq-*` gold/navy only.

## Hierarchy & composition

- **One job per section:** one headline + short support
- **First viewport (marketing):** brand/H1, one short lead, one CTA group, optional hero media — no card grids in the hero
- Prefer shells: `PageHeroHeader` · `LeafHero` · `SectionHeaderRow` · `CenteredSectionHeader` · `ContentCard`
- Cards wrap **one** primary action only — no nested competing links

## Navigation (below `lg` / &lt;1024px)

- Desktop horizontal nav starts at **`lg:`** (`lg:flex` in `Header`) — drawer for all viewports below 1024px
- Mobile: hamburger + slide-out drawer (`HeaderMobileMenu`, lazy `dynamic` / `ssr: false`)
- Do not ship a second competing mobile nav pattern (bottom bar, etc.) unless product asks
- Drawer: focus trap, close ≥44px, `env(safe-area-inset-*)`, keyboard operable without hover
- Do **not** treat `md` (768) as the desktop-nav breakpoint — that is layout/`md` hero only (`18`, `09`)

## Touch & targets

- Interactive hit area ≥ **44×44px** (`TW_TOUCH` / `min-h-11` / `min-w-11`)
- ≥8px gap between adjacent tap targets
- Primary CTA reachable on long pages (section / leaf banner — not only footer)
- Sticky/floating UI (header, WhatsApp) must not cover fields, focus rings, or leaf CTAs
- Never rely on hover-only affordances on touch

## Forms & feedback

- Full-width fields on mobile (`TW_FORM_*`); stack via `TW_GRID_2`
- `type` + `inputMode` (`tel`, `email`); visible labels; errors beside fields
- `aria-busy` / `aria-live` on submit; prevent double-submit
- Heavy widgets (Turnstile): load on intersect

## Tables & dense data

- Wide tables: wrap in `overflow-x-auto` **or** card/stacked layout below `md`
- Pricing / comparison: prefer stacked cards on phone (`TW_CONTAINER_PRICING` patterns) over unreadable multi-column tables

## Motion & feedback

- `prefers-reduced-motion` + `motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0`
- Prefer opacity/transform; avoid layout animation that causes CLS
- Reveal visible on mobile / no-JS (`09`)
- Visible `:focus-visible` — never bare `outline-none`
- Press feedback: `active:*` states (not hover-only)

## Density & readability

- Section padding via `TW_SECTION_PY`
- Narrower prose on phone; Nastaliq leading ≥1.9 (`03-rtl-urdu.mdc`)
- Empty/error: Urdu + clear next action (`app/error.tsx`)

## Anti-patterns

- Desktop-only hover as sole affordance
- Fixed `px` layout widths / desktop-first `max-*` grids
- Pill clusters that wrap into unusable stacks
- Second design language (purple gradients, cream/serif defaults, dark mode)

